{'kind':'p','text':"$1.5M–$5M+",'cap':true},
{'kind':'h3','text':"The Peninsula"},
{'kind':'p','text':"An exclusive gated golf and yacht club community on a private peninsula in Lake Norman. Features a Tom Fazio–designed golf course, full-service marina, and some of the lake's most prestigious estates."},
{'kind':'p','text':"$2M–$8M+",'cap':true},
{'kind':'h3','text':"Cornelius Waterfront"},
{'kind':'p','text':"Properties along the downtown waterfront near the Port of Cornelius, Cornelius Waterfront Park, and Hello Sailor. Walkable to restaurants, shops, and marina facilities."},
{'kind':'p','text':"$1.2M–$4M+",'cap':true},
{'kind':'h3','text':"Catawba Cove"},
{'kind':'p','text':"A sought-after lakefront enclave with deep-water docks, mature tree canopies, and large lots offering privacy and direct lake access. Prime for custom builds and luxury renovations."},
{'kind':'p','text':"$1.5M–$4M+",'cap':true},
{'kind':'h3','text':"Nautical Point"},
{'kind':'p','text':"Waterfront and water-view homesites in a quiet, established section of Cornelius with deep-water access, private docks, and proximity to both Jetton Park and downtown."},
{'kind':'p','text':"$1M–$3.5M+",'cap':true},
{'kind':'h3','text':"Lake-Adjacent Estates"},
{'kind':'p','text':"Interior Cornelius lots offering lake proximity without waterfront premiums. Many feature deeded lake access, community docks, and easy walking or biking to parks and restaurants."},
{'kind':'p','text':"$800K–$2M+",'cap':true},
{'kind':'p','text':"OUR SERVICES",'cap':true},
{'kind':'h2','text':"What We Build in Cornelius"},
{'kind':'h3','text':"Lakefront & New Construction"},
{'kind':'p','text':"Cornelius offers some of Lake Norman's most desirable building opportunities — from waterfront teardown-rebuilds to new construction on premium lots with dock access. Peters Custom Homes navigates the complexities of lakefront building, including shoreline regulations, dock permitting, and flood zone requirements."},
{'kind':'li','text':"Waterfront estate construction with dock"},
{'kind':'li','text':"Teardown & rebuild on premium lakefront lots"},
{'kind':'li','text':"Lake-view & lake-access custom homes"},
{'kind':'li','text':"Outdoor living: infinity pools, boat houses & terraces"},
{'kind':'h3','text':"Whole-Home Renovations"},
{'kind':'p','text':"Many of Cornelius's most valuable lakefront properties were built in the 1990s and 2000s. Homeowners love the location and water access but need modernized layouts, luxury finishes, and expanded outdoor living. Peters Custom Homes delivers comprehensive renovations that maximize every lakefront advantage."},
{'kind':'li','text':"Complete interior gut renovations"},
{'kind':'li','text':"Lake-facing wall-of-glass additions"},
{'kind':'li','text':"Kitchen, bath & primary suite transformations"},
{'kind':'li','text':"Dock upgrades, pool additions & outdoor kitchens"},
{'kind':'p','text':"WHY CORNELIUS",'cap':true},
{'kind':'h2','text':"What Sets Cornelius Apart"},
{'kind':'h3','text':"Marina & Dock Access"},
{'kind':'p','text':"Multiple marinas including the Port of Cornelius and Jetton Park Marina provide boat slips, fuel, and full-service facilities. Many waterfront homes include private docks with deep-water access."},
{'kind':'h3','text':"Jetton Park"},
{'kind':'p','text':"105 acres of lakefront parkland with beaches, walking trails, picnic areas, fishing piers, and The Galley restaurant — Cornelius's signature outdoor amenity and gathering place."},
{'kind':'h3','text':"Waterfront Dining"},
{'kind':'p','text':"Hello Sailor, Harbor Grill, The Galley, and a growing restaurant scene make Cornelius Lake Norman's dining destination — many within walking distance of residential neighborhoods."},
{'kind':'h3','text':"Top-Rated Schools"},
{'kind':'p','text':"Served by CMS and nearby charter/private options including Lake Norman Charter, Pine Lake Preparatory, and Community School of Davidson — offering families exceptional education choices."},
{'kind':'h3','text':"Charlotte Proximity"},
{'kind':'p','text':"Just 20 minutes to Uptown Charlotte via I-77, Cornelius offers the rare combination of lake lifestyle with city convenience. SouthPark and Ballantyne are 25–30 minutes south."},
{'kind':'h3','text':"Vibrant Downtown"},
{'kind':'p','text':"A walkable downtown waterfront with shops, restaurants, the Waterfront Park boardwalk, and community events creates a small-town charm that larger lake communities lack."},
{'kind':'p','text':"LAKE NORMAN COMPARISON",'cap':true},
{'kind':'h2','text':"Cornelius vs. Lake Norman Towns"},
{'kind':'p','text':"FAQ",'cap':true},
{'kind':'h2','text':"Frequently Asked Questions"},
{'kind':'h3','text':"What makes Cornelius one of the best Lake Norman towns for luxury living?"},
{'kind':'p','text':"Cornelius is Lake Norman's most vibrant lakeside town, featuring Jetton Park (105 acres of lakefront parkland), the Port of Cornelius marina, a walkable downtown waterfront with celebrated restaurants like Hello Sailor and Harbor Grill, top-rated schools, and direct I-77 access to Charlotte — all just 20 minutes from Uptown."},
{'kind':'h3','text':"How much does it cost to build a custom home in Cornelius?"},
{'kind':'p','text':"Custom homes in Cornelius typically range from $1 million to $5 million+, depending on waterfront access, lot size, lake views, dock availability, and architectural complexity. Lakefront properties command the highest premiums, while interior lots offer excellent value with community lake access."},
{'kind':'h3','text':"Does Peters Custom Homes do renovations in Cornelius?"},
{'kind':'p','text':"Yes. Many of Cornelius's most valuable lakefront properties were built in the 1990s and 2000s. Peters Custom Homes modernizes layouts, upgrades finishes, and maximizes lake views through comprehensive whole-home renovations that preserve valuable waterfront positions."},
{'kind':'h3','text':"What schools serve the Cornelius area?"},
{'kind':'p','text':"Cornelius offers top-rated CMS schools, charter options like Lake Norman Charter School, and private schools including Pine Lake Preparatory and Community School of Davidson — providing families with exceptional education choices at every level."},
{'kind':'h3','text':"What amenities does Cornelius offer?"},
{'kind':'p','text':"Cornelius offers Jetton Park (105 lakefront acres), the Port of Cornelius marina, Cornelius Waterfront Park with boardwalk, celebrated restaurants (Hello Sailor, Harbor Grill, The Galley), multiple boat clubs and marinas, and a vibrant downtown — all centered around Lake Norman's 520 miles of shoreline."},
{'kind':'h3','text':"How far is Cornelius from Uptown Charlotte?"},
{'kind':'p','text':"Cornelius is approximately 20 miles north of Uptown Charlotte, with a typical drive time of 20–30 minutes via I-77. The town sits centrally on Lake Norman between Davidson to the north and Huntersville to the south."},
{'kind':'p','text':"BEGIN YOUR CORNELIUS LAKEFRONT HOME",'cap':true},
{'kind':'h2','text':"Build or Renovate in Cornelius"},
{'kind':'p','text':"Whether you're building a waterfront estate with a private dock, renovating a lakefront property to maximize views, or constructing a custom home near Jetton Park, Peters Custom Homes brings nearly a decade of luxury building experience to Lake Norman's most vibrant town."}
